ut tissue recipients, including their age range, gender, location and type of transplant.\n\nMTF Biologics has several volunteer groups comprised of donor family members and tissue recipients who share their stories and encourage others to consider donation. Many families have found that being involved with other donor families has a profound effect on their lives, and appreciate the opportunity to share the story of their loved ones. Tissue recipients have inspirational stories of how a transplant transformed their lives. Our volunteer groups are located in NY, NJ, and PA. We can provide you with information on"
