honoring donor, Ishmiel Ward.\n\nIsh, as his family calls him, is remembered as a gentle giant with big, bright eyes and a most beautiful smile. His sister describes him as sweet, loving and always there when she needed him. Despite a rough childhood, Ish did well in school, was involved in church, and aspired to join the military. Tragically, in June 2011, Ish's life was cut short. When approached about organ"
